OL,3,CFire crews in France battling
OL,4,Cwildfires racing against next heatwave
OL,6,FThousands of firefighters in France
OL,7,Fare racing against time to contain
OL,8,Funprecedented wildfires in the wine-
OL,9,Fgrowing Bordeaux region before another
OL,10,Fheatwave grips the area.
OL,12,FThe massive wildfire in the south-west
OL,13,Fof France has stabilised, but with
OL,14,Ftemperatures set to soar again on
OL,15,FTuesday to 35C, fire crews are using
OL,16,Fearth movers to clear strips of forest
OL,17,Fand scrubland to create barren spaces,
OL,18,Fintended to block the flames that have
OL,19,Fcome within 10 miles of Bordeaux's
OL,20,Foutskirts.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/9
