OL,3,CFire crews in France battling
OL,4,Cwildfires racing against next heatwave
OL,6,FAbout 250,000 residents and tourists
OL,7,Fin south-west France have fled their
OL,8,Fhomes and are sheltering in temporary
OL,9,Faccommodation.
OL,11,FFrench president Emmanuel Macron
OL,12,Fvisited the affected area on Monday
OL,13,Fand urged fire crews to "stay strong"
OL,14,Fas they continued to battle the highly
OL,15,Funpredictable blaze.
OL,17,FMacron praised fire crews who stopped
OL,18,Fthe fire's progression after
OL,19,Fsuccessive days of spreading flames,
OL,20,Fbut cautioned that the battle was not
OL,21,Fover.
