OL,3,CFire crews in France battling
OL,4,Cwildfires racing against next heatwave
OL,6,FWith France about to enter its peak
OL,7,FAugust tourist season, authorities for
OL,8,Fthe Gironde region around Bordeaux
OL,9,Fworked to keep vacationers away,
OL,10,Fbanning holiday camps for children and
OL,11,Fpeople with disabilities.
OL,13,FGovernment ministers also urged people
OL,14,Fnot to travel to the region.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/9
