OL,3,CFire crews in France battling
OL,4,Cwildfires racing against next heatwave
OL,6,FGironde region's fire chief told
OL,7,FMacron how crews had wrestled with the
OL,8,Fblaze, unlike any they had previously
OL,9,Ftackled, "a fire that's going
OL,10,Feverywhere" and which generated
OL,11,Felectrical storms that sparked more
OL,12,Fflare-ups.
OL,14,F"The last 24 hours went well, thanks
OL,15,Fto your work," Macron told
OL,16,Ffirefighters. "Doubtless, tomorrow
OL,17,Fwill be more complicated than today."
OL,19,FSpain is also battling fires
