OL,3,CFire crews in France battling
OL,4,Cwildfires racing against next heatwave
OL,6,FAround a dozen countries have provided
OL,7,Fplanes, helicopters, firefighters and
OL,8,Fother assistance to both France and
OL,9,FSpain, which is also fighting
OL,10,Funprecedented blazes.
OL,12,FFires in the two countries have forced
OL,13,Fmore than 330,000 people to flee.
OL,15,FIn Spain, wildfires have burned out of
OL,16,Fcontrol around Madrid and in the
OL,17,FValencia region. Authorities evacuated
OL,18,F79,000 people and confined 30,000
OL,19,Fothers to their homes.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/9
