OL,3,CFire crews in France battling
OL,4,Cwildfires racing against next heatwave
OL,6,FIn both Spain and France, the
OL,7,Fexceptional scale of the fires `
OL,8,Ffueled by heatwaves that hit
OL,9,Fespecially hard and early this year,
OL,10,Fmaking forests and scrubland tinder-
OL,11,Fdry ` are driving calls for stronger
OL,12,Faction against climate change.
OL,14,F"What we are experiencing is not a
OL,15,Fseries of isolated incidents. It is
OL,16,Fthe consequence of a climate emergency
OL,17,Fthat is making wildfires even more
OL,18,Fviolent, heatwaves more frequent,"
OL,19,FSpanish Prime Minister Pedro Sanchez
OL,20,Fsaid.
