OL,3,CFire crews in France battling
OL,4,Cwildfires racing against next heatwave
OL,6,FA fire raging in hilly, rural terrain
OL,7,Fin Avila, west of Madrid, has become
OL,8,FSpain's largest on record, scorching
OL,9,F193 square miles, the government said.
OL,11,FThe minister said that another heat
OL,12,Fwave forecast from Tuesday ` which
OL,13,Fwould be Spain's fourth so far this
OL,14,Fyear ` could ratchet up the fire
OL,15,Fdanger. Spain's weather agency
OL,16,Fforecast temperatures above 40C.
OL,18,FWater-dropping planes combat fire in
OL,19,FItaly
