OL,3,CFire crews in France battling
OL,4,Cwildfires racing against next heatwave
OL,6,FA wildfire driven by strong winds
OL,7,Fbroke out on Sunday afternoon near
OL,8,FPeschici, in Italy's southern Puglia
OL,9,Fregion, burning pine forest and scrub
OL,10,Fand forcing the evacuation of about
OL,11,F300 tourists from beaches and
OL,12,Fcampgrounds, authorities said.
OL,14,FThe coastguard evacuated tourists by
OL,15,Fsea to nearby Vieste, where
OL,16,Fauthorities opened temporary shelters.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/9
