OL,3,CFire crews in France battling
OL,4,Cwildfires racing against next heatwave
OL,6,FThree Canadair water-bombing planes
OL,7,Fand fire crews on the ground continued
OL,8,FMonday to battle the blaze, which
OL,9,Frevived memories of devastating
OL,10,Fwildfires that hit the same coastal
OL,11,Farea in 2007.
